atom	audited(x)	x is audited
atom	patched(x)	x is patched
atom	exposed(x)	x is exposed
atom	monitored(x)	x is monitored
atom	billed(x)	x is billed
P1	S1	all s: patched(s) -> audited(s)
P2	S2	exposed(mail)
P3	S3	all s: patched(s) -> monitored(s)
P4	S4	audited(mail)
P5	S5	!monitored(web)
P6	S5	billed(web)
C	S6	monitored(mail)
